OL,3,AThree held over woman's murder as South
OL,4,AAfrica police investigate eight other
OL,5,Abody finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree suspects have been detained in
OL,8,FSouth Africa in connection with the
OL,9,Fmurder of a woman in an area east of
OL,10,FJohannesburg ` the last of nine recent
OL,11,Fcases in that region that has shone a
OL,12,Fspotlight on the level of violence
OL,13,Fagainst women in the country.
OL,15,FUnder pressure to solve the spate of
OL,16,Fmurders which has involved victims'
OL,17,Fbodies being dumped on a roadside,
OL,18,Fpolice have described the arrests of
OL,19,Fthe three ` a man and two women - as a
OL,20,F"breakthrough".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
