OL,3,AThree held over woman's murder as South
OL,4,AAfrica police investigate eight other
OL,5,Abody finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FReferring to all nine cases, acting
OL,8,Fpolice chief Lt Gen Puleng Dimpane said
OL,9,Fher officers were "working tirelessly
OL,10,Fto bring those responsible to justice".
OL,12,FThe three suspects are due in court on
OL,13,FMonday.
